of the Rainbow Live.

5
00:00:09,453 --> 00:00:12,693
To celebrate 2026,
the Year of the Red Horse,

6
00:00:12,853 --> 00:00:14,322
we began a new project,
Rainbow Running Horses.

7
00:00:14,323 --> 00:00:15,562
- Do you remember?
- Yes.

8
00:00:15,563 --> 00:00:17,462
He's the second star
of Rainbow Running Horses.

9
00:00:17,463 --> 00:00:20,662
He's the bassist
of a Korean rock band, Crying Nut,

10
00:00:20,663 --> 00:00:23,373
and also the living legend who ruled
the golden era of indie music.

11
00:00:23,533 --> 00:00:25,773
Let's sing it together.
One, two, three, four.

12
00:00:26,203 --> 00:00:30,712
(Let's run)

13
00:00:30,713 --> 00:00:32,472
Here's Han Kyung Rok!

14
