(Han Kyung Rok)

15
00:00:34,113 --> 00:00:35,113
(Shaking)

16
00:00:35,114 --> 00:00:36,183
Hello.

17
00:00:37,053 --> 00:00:38,113
Hello.

18
00:00:39,153 --> 00:00:40,253
Nice to meet you.

19
